{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to be a MOTO ROADER?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine a time in the future when evil has been erased. Life\u2019s tasks are handled by machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What will kids do to heat things up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They\u2019ll all be MOTO ROADERS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Man and machine come together in a race of speed, skill, luck, power and strategy. Race up to four other drivers. Eight heats per race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure you spend price money on killer part and weapons \u2013 not on weird shades and fuzzy dice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic legacy title</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from multiple cars and drivers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Numerous race tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple game modes including bumper car challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 player local coop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save state function: save wherever you want to in the game, and restart from that exact point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Screen filters: select from several filters to modify how the game looks (retro-style monitor, black-and-white, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gallery: view images from the original game\u2019s manual and box design</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577700?t=1741923728","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577700/a98b415d276f3fcf0090861e564d9eead4774a0c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741923728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577700/e9aaf88b7b54fe3fafa37be5ef47bcb0bbcf326a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741923728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577700/e9aaf88b7b54fe3fafa37be5ef47bcb0bbcf326a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741923728","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to be a MOTO ROADER?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine a time in the future when evil has been erased. Life\u2019s tasks are handled by machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What will kids do to heat things up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They\u2019ll all be MOTO ROADERS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Man and machine come together in a race of speed, skill, luck, power and strategy. Race up to four other drivers. Eight heats per race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure you spend price money on killer part and weapons \u2013 not on weird shades and fuzzy dice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic legacy title</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from multiple cars and drivers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Numerous race tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple game modes including bumper car challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 player local coop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save state function: save wherever you want to in the game, and restart from that exact point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Screen filters: select from several filters to modify how the game looks (retro-style monitor, black-and-white, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gallery: view images from the original game\u2019s manual and box design</p></li></ul>","developers":["Extreme"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577700/b913cce9bffa5a46c43415d9e594d70314a9d9c0/header.jpg?t=1741923728","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Moto Roader \u300c\u30e2\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30c0\u30fc\u300d","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> core2duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Ratalaika Games S.L.","Shinyuden"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i